150.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"mandms logo\\\" width=\\\"186\\\" height=\\\"93\\\" srcset=\\\"/uploads/articles/ux-psychology-principles-design-ux/inline-53.jpg 300w, /uploads/articles/ux-psychology-principles-design-ux/inline-12.jpg 318w\\\" sizes=\\\"(max-width: 186px) 100vw, 186px\\\" />\\x3C/p>\\n\\x3Cp>&nbsp;\\x3C/p>\\n\\x3Cp>&nbsp;\\x3C/p>\\n\\x3Cp>&nbsp;\\x3C/p>\\n\\x3Cp>&nbsp;\\x3C/p>\\n\\x3Cp>&nbsp;\\x3C/p>\\n\\x3Cp>\\x3Cb>Black:\\x3C/b>\\x3Ci>\\x3Cspan style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\"> sophistication, luxury, seductive, formal, authority, strength\\x3C/span>\\x3C/i>\\x3C/p>\\n\\x3Cp>\\x3Cspan style=\\\"font-weight: 400;\\\">Black is most often seen used by high-end brands to portray their sophistication and luxurious products and services. News channel BBC, uses black in their logo to portray authority.\u00a0\\x3C/span>\\x3C/p>\\n\\x3Cp>\\x3Cimg loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" class=\\\"alignleft wp-image-11703 \\\" src=\\\"/wp-content/uploads/2018/03/aubyc5cY8WfM2EuyETuPUhn35tYHnI5ALRisbSXtQsxkwZlKbvSgbf2mfFRG-GnqI6vv3a_VMmI37JIlR8BDdswG1kEmoi-EgLscCdZ6V_QoDUz2wtpwogvEywzvaVR__n3blrlA-e1521031672984.png\\\" alt=\\\"Nike logo\\\" width=\\\"189\\\" height=\\\"136\\\" />\\x3C/p>\\n\\x3Cp>&nbsp;\\x3C/p>\\n\\x3Cp>\\x3Cimg loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" class=\\\"alignleft wp-image-11704 \\\" src=\\\"/wp-content/uploads/2018/03/W7oghzjlamH8irlGi1OjhYSSwWUTyjVZcaih7GZIZfjzg63DvcZxycYb85A0BEgK0r7XVOEitPM-aDudFBgNeeXKUnHtms3Ydug8wH9rT2bFR562kH0r4qhNxog5ichdj8_SmJ2w-300x86.png\\\" alt=\\\"BBC logo\\\" width=\\\"202\\\" height=\\\"58\\\" srcset=\\\"/wp-contentuploads/2018/03/W7oghzjlamH8irlGi1OjhYSSwWUTyjVZcaih7GZIZfjzg63DvcZxycYb85A0BEgK0r7XVOEitPM-aDudFBgNeeXKUnHtms3Ydug8wH9rT2bFR562kH0r4qhNxog5ichdj8_SmJ2w-300x86.png 300w, /wp-contentuploads/2018/03/W7oghzjlamH8irlGi1OjhYSSwWUTyjVZcaih7GZIZfjzg63DvcZxycYb85A0BEgK0r7XVOEitPM-aDudFBgNeeXKUnHtms3Ydug8wH9rT2bFR562kH0r4qhNxog5ichdj8_SmJ2w-768x220.png 768w, /wp-contentuploads/2018/03/W7oghzjlamH8irlGi1OjhY