.30941 10.4783C3.35109 10.3126 2.57122 10.0643 1.96756 9.73285C1.36465 9.40034 0.922634 8.98404 0.643016 8.48249C0.363025 7.98021 0.222656 7.38824 0.222656 6.70586V0.426371H4.2157V6.15191C4.2157 6.44567 4.2564 6.72468 4.33703 6.9904C4.41805 7.25501 4.58268 7.48973 4.83169 7.69382C5.08032 7.89754 5.43497 8.05734 5.89528 8.17655C6.35558 8.29538 6.96447 8.35406 7.72381 8.35406C8.48203 8.35406 9.10174 8.29538 9.57996 8.17655C10.0589 8.05734 10.4326 7.89754 10.6996 7.69382C10.9672 7.48973 11.1479 7.25797 11.2409 6.99704C11.3342 6.73649 11.3809 6.46486 11.3809 6.18032Z\"></path></svg></div></div><script>window.__I18N__={\"en\":{\"home\":{\"intro\":{\"seoTitle\":\"Leading User Experience & UX Research Company\",\"historyOf\":\"The History Of\",\"userExperience\":\"User Experience\",\"letsExplore\":\"Let's explore through time\",\"startExperience\":\"Start Experience\",\"skipPast\":\"skip the past & show services\"},\"scenes\":{\"intro\":{\"text\":\"From the dawn of humanity to the digital age, experience design has shaped our world.\"},\"earlyHumans\":{\"title\":\"Early Humans\",\"text\":\"Long before screens and devices, people were designing tools, shelters, ways to communicate. Each invention solved a problem, making life easier. That instinct to create for others? That's where UX began.\"},\"ancientEgypt\":{\"title\":\"ANCIENT EGYPT\",\"text\":\"Ancient Egyptians built more than monuments. With intention and precision, they designed experiences from sacred spaces to rituals that met human needs and echoed across generations.\"},\"ancientChina\":{\"title\":\"ANCIENT CHINA\",\"text\":\"From water clocks to calendars, ancient China's innovations brought structure to life. These weren't just technical feats they were human centered designs that shaped rhythm, order, and connection.\"},\"ancientGreece\":{\"title\":\"ANCIENT GREECE\",\"text\":\"In ancient Greece, design met strategy. Spears, shields, and formations weren't just tools of war they were crafted for precision, protection, and purpose. A clear example of design meeting real human needs.\"},\"islamicGoldenAge\":{\"title\":\"ISLAMIC GOLDEN AGE\",\"text\":\"The Islamic Golden Age turned curiosity into clarity. With tools for astronomy and systems like algebra, thinkers designed experiences that made complex ideas easier to explore and apply.\"},\"industrialAge\":{\"title\":\"INDUSTRIAL AGE\",\"text\":\"The Industrial Age brought machines, movement, and mass production. Steam engines and factories reshaped how we work and live designing systems not just for people, but for scale and speed.\"},\"waltDisney\":{\"title\":\"WALT DISNEY\",\"text\":\"In the 1960s, Disney turned imagination into design. His parks weren't just attractions they were crafted journeys, proving that user experience could be magical, immersive, and unforgettable.\"},\"steveJobs\":{\"title\":\"Steve JOBS\",\"text\":\"Then came the iPod. With a click wheel and clean design, Steve Jobs didn't just change music he redefined how we interact with technology: simple, elegant, human.\"},\"uxbertLabs\":{\"title\":\"UXBERT LABS\",\"text\":\"From ancient tools to digital touchpoints, UX has shaped progress. At UXBERT Labs, we carry that legacy forward designing solutions that truly connect with people, right here in our region.\"}},\"mobile\":{\"explore\":\"Explore\",\"close\":\"Close\",\"explorePortfolio\":\"Explore portfolio\",\"closePortfolio\":\"Close portfolio\",\"nav\":{\"1900\":\"1900\",\"1960\":\"1960\",\"2000\":\"2000\",\"2012\":\"2012\",\"earlyHumans\":\"Early Humans\",\"ancientEgypt\":\"Ancient Egypt\",\"ancientChina\":\"Ancient China\",\"ancientGreece\":\"Ancient Greece\",\"islamicGoldenAge\":\"Islamic Golden Age\"}},\"timeline\":{\"present\":\"Present\"},\"menu\":{\"thePast\":\"The Past\",\"thePresent\":\"The Present\",\"aboutUs\":\"About us\",\"services\":\"Services\",\"caseStudies\":\"Case Studies\",\"articles\":\"Articles\",\"uxCourses\":\"UX Courses\",\"careers\":\"Careers\",\"contactUs\":\"Contact us