di Arabia: E-commerce Website Souq.com\" class=\"transition-transform duration-300 ease-in-out absolute inset-0 !h-full w-full object-contain opacity-0 transition-all duration-500 ease-in-out group-hover:opacity-100\" draggable=\"false\"/><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-black opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-500 ease-in-out group-hover:opacity-30\"></div><div class=\"relative z-10 flex h-full min-h-96 flex-col transition-all duration-500 ease-in-out\"><div class=\"flex flex-1 flex-col gap-2 p-[1.5em]\"><div class=\"line-clamp-2 min-h-[5em]\"><div class=\"min-h-[5.5em] h-auto pb-[0.3em] pt-[0.2em]\"><h3 class=\"SplitClass _eleD z-10 !normal-case !leading-[1.4] opacity-0\" style=\"text-shadow:2px 2px 11px #000\"><div>Usability Engineering in Saudi Arabia: E-commerce Website Souq.com</div></h3></div></div><div class=\"line-clamp-3 min-h-[5.5em]\"><div class=\"gray _eleY z-10 !text-sm opacity-50 transition-opacity delay-100 duration-500 ease-in-out group-hover:pointer-events-none group-hover:opacity-0\"><p>In the first of our Usability Engineering series, we ran some quick usability tests on e-services available through the Saudi Ministry of Interior\u2019s website. The aim was to show how even the simplest usability tests can bring to light significant usability flaws in your design. Moving away from government e-services, for our second article in [\u2026]</p>\n</div></div></div><div class=\"p-[1.5em] pt-0 transition-all duration-500 ease-in-out group-hover:opacity-0\"><div class=\"relative max-h-[17.8125em] overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 z-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/60 to-black/20\"></div><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerPolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"/offline/uploads/articles/usability-engineering-saudi-arabia-e-commerce-website-souq-com/sec.png\" alt=\"thumbnail for blog post Usability Engineering in Saudi Arabia: E-commerce Website Souq.com\" class=\"transition-transform duration-300 ease-in-out h-full min-h-[18.75em] w-full object-cover group-hover:opacity-0\" draggable=\"false\"/><div class=\"absolute top-4 left-4 bg-white/20 px-3 py-1 text-sm font-medium text-white backdrop-blur-sm\" style=\"text-shadow:2px 2px 11px #000\">7th February 2018</div></div></div><div class=\"absolute inset-0 flex flex-col justify-between p-6 opacity-0 transition-all duration-500 ease-in-out group-hover:opacity-100\"><div class=\"mt-[5.5em]\"><div class=\"inline-block bg-white/20 px-3 py-1 text-sm font-medium text-white backdrop-blur-sm\">7th February 2018</div></div><div class=\"flex justify-end\"><div class=\"rec_btn arrow f a-c j-c pointer\"><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerPolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"/offline/icons/link.svg\" alt=\"arrow\" class=\"transition-transform duration-300 ease-in-out \" draggable=\"false\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\"/></div></div></div></div></a></div></div><div class=\"swiper-slide\"><div class=\" fade-up transform transition-all duration-700 \" style=\"animation-delay:0.42s\"><a href=\"/en/why-ux-not-ui\" class=\"group blog-card relative h-auto min-h-[30.5em] w-full max-w-[30.625em] overflow-hidden !border !border-white/20 shadow-lg transition-all duration-500 ease-in-out hover:scale-105\"><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerPolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"/offline/uploads/articles/why-ux-not-ui/main.png\" alt=\"thumbnail for blog post Why UX is Not UI\" class=\"transition-transform duration-300 ease-in-out absolute inset-0 !h-full w-full object-contain opacity-0 transition-all duration-500 ease-in-out group-hover:opacity-100\" draggable=\"false\"/><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-black opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-500 ease-in-out group-hover:opacity-30\"></div><div class=\"relative z-10 flex h-full min-h-96 flex-col transition-all duration-500 ease-in-out\"><div class=\"flex flex-1 flex-col gap-2 p-[1.5em]\"><div class=\"line-clamp-2 min-h-[5em]\"><div class=\"min-h-[5.5em] h-auto pb-[0.3em] pt-[0.2em]\"><h3 class=\"SplitClass _eleD z-10 !normal-case !leading-[1.4] opacity-0\" style=\"text-shadow:2px 2px 11px #000\"><div>Why UX is Not UI</div></h3></div></div><div class=\"line-clamp-3 min-h-[5.5em]\"><div class=\"gray _eleY z-10 !text-sm opacity-50 transition-opacity delay-100 duration-500 ease-in-out group-hover:pointer-events-none group-hover:opacity-0\"><p>User Experience (UX) Design and User Interface (UI) Design are some of the most misused terms in our industry. Job advertisements often write \u201cUI/UX\u2019 as if they\u2019re interchangeable. But what is the difference between UX and UI? What exactly is meant by \u2018good UX\u2019 or \u2018poor UI\u2019? In this article we\u2019ll take a deeper look at what each of the terms mean.</p>\n</div></div></div><div class=\"p-[1.5em] pt-0 transition-all duration-500 ease-in-out group-hover:opacity-0\"><div class=\"relative max-h-[17.8125em] overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 z-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/60 to-black/20\"></div><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerPolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"/offline/uploads/articles/why-ux-not-ui/sec.png\" alt=\"thumbnail for blog post Why UX is Not UI\" class=\"transition-transform duration-300 ease-in-out h-full min-h-[18.75em] w-full object-cover group-hover:opacity-0\" draggable=\"false\"/><div class=\"absolute top-4 left-4 bg-white/20 px-3 py-1 text-sm font-medium text-white backdrop-blur-sm\" style=\"text-shadow:2px 2px 11px #000\">27th September 2017</div></div></div><div class=\"absolute inset-0 flex flex-col justify-between p-6 opacity-0 transition-all duration-500 ease-in-out group-hover:opacity-100\"><div class=\"mt-[5.5em]\"><div class=\"inline-block bg-white/20 px-3 py-1 text-sm font-medium text-white backdrop-blur-sm\">27th September 2017</div></div><div class=\"flex justify-end\"><div class=\"rec_btn arrow f a-c j-c pointer\"><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerPolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"/offline/icons/link.svg\" alt=\"arrow\" class=\"transition-transform duration-300 ease-in-out \" draggable=\"false\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\"/></div></div></div></div></a></div></div><div class=\"swiper-slide\"><div class=\" fade-up transform transition-all duration-700 \" style=\"animation-delay:0.48s\"><a href=\"/en/usability-engineering-saudi-arabia-ministry-of-interior\" class=\"group blog-card relative h-auto min-h-[30.5em] w-full max-w-[30.625em] overflow-hidden !border !border-white/20 shadow-lg transition-all duration-500 ease-in-out hover:scale-105\"><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerPolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"/offline/uploads/articles/usability-engineering-saudi-arabia-ministry-of-interior/main.png\" alt=\"thumbnail for blog post Usability Engineering in Saudi Arabia: Ministry of Interior E-services\" class=\"transition-transform duration-300 ease-in-out absolute inset-0 !h-full w-full object-contain opacity-0 transition-all duration-500 ease-in-out group-hover:opacity-100\" draggable=\"false\"/><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-black opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-500 ease-in-out group-hover:opacity-30\"></div><div class=\"relative z-10 flex h-full min-h-96 flex-col transition-all duration-500 ease-in-out\"><div class=\"flex flex-1 flex-col gap-2 p-[1.5em]\"><div class=\"line-clamp-2 min-h-[5em]\"><div class=\"min-h-[5.5em] h-auto pb-[0.3em] pt-[0.2em]\"><h3 class=\"SplitClass _eleD z-10 !normal-case !leading-[1.4] opacity-0\" style=\"text-shadow:2px 2px 11px #000\"><div>Usability Engineering in Saudi Arabia: Ministry of Interior E-services</div></h3></div></div><div class=\"line-clamp-3 min-h-[5.5em]\"><div class=\"gray _eleY z-10 !text-sm opacity-50 transition-opacity delay-100 duration-500 ease-in-out group-hover:pointer-events-none group-hover:opacity-0\"><p>Usability testing shows you exactly where (and why) your customers have problems using your product. Companies that invest in usability testing see direct return on investment (ROI) through increased sales and revenue, lower development cost and time, lower support costs, increased productivity and user satisfaction.</p>\n<p>In this series, we\u2019ll be conducting so called \u201cproto-research sessions\u201d to demonstrate the kinds of insights that can be collected from even informal research.</p>\n</div></div></div><div class=\"p-[1.5em] pt-0 transition-all duration-500 ease-in-out group-hover:opacity-0\"><div class=\"relative max-h-[17.8125em] overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 z-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/60 to-black/20\"></div><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerPolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"/offline/uploads/articles/usability-engineering-saudi-arabia-ministry-of-interior/sec.png\" alt=\"thumbnail for blog post Usability Engineering in Saudi Arabia: Ministry of Interior E-services\" class=\"transition-transform duration-300 ease-in-out h-full min-h-[18.75em] w-full object-cover group-hover:opacity-0\" draggable=\"false\"/><div class=\"absolute top-4 left-4 bg-white/20 px-3 py-1 text-sm font-medium text-white backdrop-blur-sm\" style=\"text-shadow:2px 2px 11px #000\">9th August 2017</div></div></div><div class=\"absolute inset-0 flex flex-col justify-between p-6 opacity-0 transition-all duration-500 ease-in-out group-hover:opacity-100\"><div class=\"mt-[5.5em]\"><div class=\"inline-block bg-white/20 px-3 py-1 text-sm font-medium text-white backdrop-blur-sm\">9th August 2017</div></div><div class=\"flex justify-end\"><div class=\"rec_btn arrow f a-c j-c pointer\"><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerPolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"/offline/icons/link.svg\" alt=\"arrow\" class=\"transition-transform duration-300 ease-in-out \" draggable=\"false\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\"/></div></div></div></div></a></div></div><div class=\"swiper-slide\"><div class=\" fade-up transform transition-all duration-700 \" style=\"animation-delay:0.54s\"><a href=\"/en/july-meetup-recap-emotional-design\" class=\"group blog-card relative h-auto min-h-[30.5em] w-full max-w-[30.625em] overflow-hidden !border !border-white/20 shadow-lg transition-all duration-500 ease-in-out hover:scale-105\"><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerPolicy=\"no-r