r-sm\" style=\"text-shadow:2px 2px 11px #000\">31st July 2017</div></div></div><div class=\"absolute inset-0 flex flex-col justify-between p-6 opacity-0 transition-all duration-500 ease-in-out group-hover:opacity-100\"><div class=\"mt-[5.5em]\"><div class=\"inline-block bg-white/20 px-3 py-1 text-sm font-medium text-white backdrop-blur-sm\">31st July 2017</div></div><div class=\"flex justify-end\"><div class=\"rec_btn arrow f a-c j-c pointer\"><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerPolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"/offline/icons/link.svg\" alt=\"arrow\" class=\"transition-transform duration-300 ease-in-out \" draggable=\"false\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\"/></div></div></div></div></a></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section></div></div><script>$RC(\"B:1\",\"S:1\")</script></body></html>"